		{
			dependencies: ["3A26F553422DC48B"]
			dependency_requirement: "all_started"
			description: ["The seed pouch is a useful tool that acts like bundle for seeds and other plants such as saplings. Able to hold up to 10 stacks of a single seed, you can use it on soil or dirt and it will plant its contents as if you were holding them. What's more, any seeds you pick up will be immediately put inside the pouch if there's room."]
