		{
			dependencies: ["37043064988891A4"]
			description: [
				"You may be wondering, \"If I need to constantly eat a variety of foods, won't that fill up my inventory?\" And you would be correct. That's where the &o&6lunchbag&r comes into play."
				"Crouching and right clicking will open the bag's menu, wherein you can place up to &ofive different foods&r. From there, the bag can be used as a food item itself. When eating from the bag, &o&6it will automatically pick a food from its contents that best keeps your diversity level high&r."
