		{
			dependencies: ["15ACD993630984F4"]
			description: ["The Skillet is a very versatile tool that acts as both a weapon &oand&r a portable cooking station. By holding raw food in your offhand while near a heatsource, you can cook the items by using the skillet. Alternatively, you can place the skillet down on a heat source, and use it as a much faster alternative to a campfire."]
