		{
			dependencies: ["15ACD993630984F4"]
			description: ["The Cooking Pot is a major utility for cooking, and is the primary source of most more complex recipes. When using it, you will be shown 6 slots for ingredients and one slot for a container, along with an icon to show if there is a required heat source below. When ingredients are placed in the pot according to a recipe, it will begin cooking said recipe without any input, similar to furnaces. The final item will appear on the right. If it requires a container, you will not be able to take the food until the right container is given. In most cases, these are bowls, but there are cases where it is not."]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			id: "0E6BB4D44EFA29A9"
			rewards: [{
				amount: 100L
